mlxflow 0.8
1. Read Text           cases.txt   # one prompt per line
2. Split               by=lines   text -> [text]
3. <each run_one; on_error=skip>   [text] -> [text]
     1. <list flow_under_test>   (input:1)   # your flow, pasted in
          1. Draft   Qwen3 8B; "Say hello in one short sentence."
     2. Template   (input:1,1)   "### {1}\n{2}"
4. Join Text           separator="\n\n"
5. Save Text           run-today.md

6. Read Text           run-baseline.md

7. Diff        (4,6)   format=unified
8. Save Text           regression.diff
